.  Jim's dplogf.tex settings
.
SET MINMAX MIN
CHARACTER MAPPING RANK
TIC OFFSET UNITS SCREEN
TIC OFFSET 5 5
TITLE DISPLACEMENT 2
DIMENSION 40 VARIABLES
SET WRITE DECIMALS 2
CASE ASIS
TITLE CASE ASIS
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL CASE ASIS
CHARACTER CASE ASIS ALL
LEGEND CASE ASIS
.
title size 4
label cases asis
label size 4
tic label size 4
legend size 4
.
